              <div class="space-y-1">
                <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-rose-950 m-0">Choosing plated service without pricing buffet first.</h4>
                <p class="text-xs text-rose-900 leading-relaxed m-0">Plated courses require high server-to-guest ratios and dish rentals that add $1,500+ quickly.</p>
              </div>
